---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About and contact"
  description="3DEngelen's 3D printer experience, materials brands, and public contact."
>
  <div class="page-intro section-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">MAKER PROFILE</p>
    <h1>
      About<span class="accent">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p>Printer and materials experience.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="about-content section-shell">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / PROFILE</p>
      <h2>Maker</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      3DEngelen's printer ownership includes current Creality systems and
      previously owned machines from Bambu Lab, Qidi, and Flashforge.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / PRINTER EXPERIENCE</p>
      <h2>Printers</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      <strong>Currently owned:</strong> Creality K1C; Creality K2 Pro with CFS.
      <br />
      <strong>Previously owned:</strong> Bambu Lab A1 mini; Qidi X-Plus 3;
      Flashforge Adventurer 5M.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / MATERIALS</p>
      <h2>Brands</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Polymaker, Bambu Lab, Creality, Landu, and Flashforge.</p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">04 / CONTACT</p>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:3DEngelen@gmail.com">3DEngelen@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
